          "text": "## Recommendation\n\nApprove policy exception for revenue recognition timing. The audit findings, contract clause verification, and settlement parameters demonstrate that deferring revenue recognition until the settlement date complies with legal standards and does not breach accounting policy. Aarav Tanaka (General Counsel) is therefore authorized to issue the final sign‑off, confirming the exception.",
